sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Cliente
    participant API as "erp-api<br/>QueryProductsControllersV1<br/>(vars: id:String, sku:String, text:String, category:String)"
    participant App as "erp-application<br/>FindProductByIdQuery.execute(id)<br/>FindProductBySkuQuery.execute(sku)<br/>FindProductActiveQuery.execute()<br/>FindProductByTextQuery.execute(text)<br/>FindProductByCategory.execute(category)"
    participant Domain as "erp-domain<br/>ProductView (DTO)<br/>ProductRoot extends AggregateRoot<ProductId> -> Entity<ProductId>"
    participant Infra as "erp-infrastructure<br/>ProductRepository / ProductCatalogRepositoryPort (DB / Search)"
    participant Common as "erp-common<br/>DTOs / Exceptions: ProductView, QueryException"

    Note over Client,API: Obtener producto por ID
    Client->>API: GET /queries/products/{id}
    API->>App: FindProductByIdQuery.execute(id)
    App->>Infra: ProductRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: Optional<ProductView>
    App-->>API: ProductView or throw QueryException
    API-->>Client: 200 OK { ProductView }

    Note over Client,API: Obtener por SKU
    Client->>API: GET /queries/products?sku={sku}
    API->>App: FindProductBySkuQuery.execute(sku)
    App->>Infra: ProductRepository.findBySku(sku)
    Infra-->>App: Optional<ProductView>
    App-->>API: ProductView
    API-->>Client: 200 OK { ProductView }

    Note over Client,API: Listar productos activos
    Client->>API: GET /queries/products/active
    API->>App: FindProductActiveQuery.execute()
    App->>Infra: ProductRepository.findActive()
    Infra-->>App: List<ProductView>
    App-->>API: List<ProductView> (or 204 No Content)
    API-->>Client: 200 OK / 204 No Content

    Note over Client,API: Búsqueda por texto / categoría
    Client->>API: GET /queries/products/search?text={text}
    API->>App: FindProductByTextQuery.execute(text)
    App->>Infra: ProductRepository.searchByText(text)
    Infra-->>App: List<ProductView>
    App-->>API: List<ProductView>
    API-->>Client: 200 OK [ ProductView... ]

    Client->>API: GET /queries/products?category={category}
    API->>App: FindProductByCategory.execute(category)
    App->>Infra: ProductRepository.findByCategory(category)
    Infra-->>App: List<ProductView>
    App-->>API: List<ProductView>
    API-->>Client: 200 OK [ ProductView... ]
